{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["יִשָּׂא פַרְעֹה אֶת רֹאשֶׁךָ — like: ״שְׂאוּ אֶת רֹאשְׁכֶם לְכָל עֲדַת״ and so forth — Pharaoh will appoint you among his servants." "וְהֵשִׁיבְךָ — to restore you to your station. And thus it is written: ״וַיִּשָּׂא אֶת רֹאשׁ שַׂר הַמַּשְׁקִים בְּתוֹךְ עֲבָדָיו״. But וַהֲשִׁיבֹךָ יְהֹוָה means 'and He will restore you.'"], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:46:49.402279084Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}